{"page_id": "olmo_table_tests-0486cc2ec11e21b6a8280ca71073ca28ea3f_pg1-p1", "markdown": "# Rustfri federdæmpere\n\nVIBRATIONSDÆMPERE\n\nFDA-316\n\nProduktbeskrivelse\n\nKonstrueret for vibrationsisolering af maskiner med et omdrejningstal på mere end 450 0/min.\n\nKan belastes fra 12-125kg.\n\nKomponenter\n\n- Rustfri Stålfjeder FDA 25-75 i AISI 316L, 850t salttăge FDA 100-125 i AISI 302, 650t salttâge\n- Top og bund kappe AISI 316L Bund skrue AISI 316L\n\n4 Fodplade AISI 316L\n\nEVA gummi, påklæbet\n\nAnvendelse\n\nSpecielt egnet til udendørsanlæg el. anlæg opstillet i agressive miljøer. generatorer, kompressorer, ventilationsanlæg, pumper, køleanlæg m.fl.\n\nTYPE FDA-316\n\nTYPE FDA-316B1\n\n<table>\n<tr><td>Type</td><td>Maks Belastning [kgl</td><td>Nedbøjning [mm]</td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA025-316</td><td>25</td><td>24</td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA025-316B1</td><td>25</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA025-316B2</td><td>25</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA050-316</td><td>50</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA050-316B1</td><td>50</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA050-31682ł</td><td>50</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA075-316</td><td>75</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA075-316B1</td><td>75</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA075-316B2</td><td>75</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA100-316</td><td>100</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA100-316B1</td><td>100</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA100-316B2ł</td><td>100</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA125-316</td><td>125</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA125-316B1</td><td>125</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>FDA125-316B2</td><td>125</td><td>24</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nTYPE FDA-31682\n\nFodplade\n\nVIBRATIONS@IAC-NORDIC.DK\n\nWWW.IAC-NORDIC.DK\n\nla sa coustics\n\n+4536 77 8800\n\n105", "width": 1654, "height": 2339, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "Rustfri federdæmpere", "bbox": {"x": 92.42941151843016, "y": 97.45833331506, "width": 394.0411764705882, "height": 29.237499999999898}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "VIBRATIONSDÆMPERE", "bbox": {"x": 1201.5823527012733, "y": 14.6